021 co-show  runners joe henderson and ildi mojovic  assured fans that they would still see  trixie in the second half of season five  and season six they explained in both  season 5b and season six fans will still  definitely get their trixie fix we adore  scarlet and shuffled things around a bit  to make sure we could keep the tale of  the future president of mars going the  shuffling occurred because estevez had  also booked a christmas movie for disney  titled christmas again filming occurred  at the end of 2020 which overlapped with  production on season 6 of lucifer but  that wasn't the 13 year old actress's  only other work commitment she had also  landed a lead role in an upcoming disney  channel original series it seems that  estevez's smaller presence in the final  season was the unfortunate result of  scheduling conflicts that's a shame  considering how much fun it sounds like  estevez had on a set of lucifer scarlett  estevez is still a young talent but she  is already a pro at doing interviews  in the past she has spoken about her  experiences filming lucifer and based on  what she'd had to say it sounds like she  had a blast to working with her co-stars  while speaking with daily dead estevez  was asked about tom ellis and leslie and  brandt her response was glowing  tom is awesome he has daughters so he is  really good with kids lucifer doesn't  really enjoy being around trixie but i  would say in real life he's happy when  i'm around and leslie ann is the best we  have a really great relationship offset  we've gotten together on days we aren't  filming a couple times and i really love  being around her and it's not just her  fellow cast members who estevez loved  working with on twitter the series  showrunner ld modrovich posted a  behind-the-scenes picture of herself and  estevez with the caption scarlett's  estevez is truly an angel in this earth  estevez responded with her own tweet  writing quote love this sending you a  big hug it looks like even though her  screen time in the final season ended up  being limited estevez enjoyed her stint  on the show luckily fans looking to  revisit the character on lucifer can now  stream all six seasons on netflix check  out one of our newest videos right here  plus even more looper videos about your  favorite shows are coming soon subscribe  to our youtube channel and hit the bell  so you don't miss a single one  [Music]
 

